<title>UK: UK reserves fall underlying $109 mln in December.</title>
<headline>UK reserves fall underlying $109 mln in December.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's gold and currency reserves fell an underlying $109 million in December, the Treasury said. (IN MLN DOLLARS EXCEPT WHERE STATED)</p>
<p>					 December	     November</p>
<p> Underlying reserves	  -109		    - 98.0</p>
